+# Path to 100% Coverage Plan - Dataset Archive Format Normalization
+
+## Context
+- Full-suite run surfaced a failure in `tests/test_dataset_management.py::test_dataset_manager_create_archive`.
+- Root cause: `create_compressed_archive(..., format="tar.gz")` did not enter tar branch because stage check only accepted strings ending in `.tar.gz` or exact `tar`.
+
+## Fix Strategy
